y aids and chronological timelines for Day 10.","formulasOrKeyRules":["5-Minute active recall every 45 mins","Night error log remediation"]}]'::jsonb, '{"testId":"test_tnpsc_g2_d10","title":"TNPSC Group 2 Daily Speed CBT Drill (Day 10)","tamilTitle":"நாள் 10 இணையவழி மாதிரித் தேர்வு (25 வினாக்கள்)","totalQuestions":25,"durationMinutes":25,"passingScore":20,"questions":[{"id":"q_g2_d10_1","question":"Sample Assessment for Day 10: Master Question 1 covering Tamil and GS.","questionTamil":"நாள் 10 பாடப்பகுதி மாதிரி வினா 1: பாடத்திட்ட அடிப்படையிலான தேர்வு.","options":{"A":"Option A (சரியான விடை)","B":"Option B","C":"Option C","D":"Option D"},"correctOption":"A","explanation":"Detailed explanation based on TNPSC syllabus standard."}]}'::jsonb, '{"asanaName":"Surya Namaskar & Nadi Shodhana Pranayama","tamilName":"சூரிய நமஸ்காரம் & நாடி சுத்தி பிராணாயாமம்","durationMinutes":15,"benefits":"Enhances neuro-cerebral oxygenation, sharpens memory retention and calms exam anxiety.","brainBoosterTask":"Solve 10 mental math calculation sprints without paper or pen in under 3 minutes."}'::jsonb
